# Project: Quarkus microservice template

Java 21 + Quarkus (REST/Jackson, JDBC PostgreSQL), built with the Maven wrapper (`./mvnw`) only — this is not a Gradle project; never use `gradle`/`gradlew` commands or Gradle snippets from Quarkus docs. There is no JavaScript/TypeScript in this repo; ignore TS-specific rules.

- Build: `./mvnw -B compile` — Tests: `./mvnw -B test` — Full verify + integration tests: `./mvnw -B verify -DskipITs=false`
- Dev server: `./mvnw quarkus:dev` (HTTP 8080, debug 5005)
- Security SAST gate: `./mvnw -B compile spotbugs:check` (see the `security-scan` skill for the full scan suite)
- Tests and dev mode start a PostgreSQL Testcontainer (Dev Services), which requires Docker. On Docker-less machines append: `-Dquarkus.datasource.devservices.enabled=false -Dquarkus.datasource.jdbc.url=jdbc:postgresql://127.0.0.1:5432/app`
- For details and troubleshooting, load the `quarkus-build-test` skill.
- Dependency versions are managed by the Quarkus platform BOM (`quarkus.platform.version` in `pom.xml`); do not pin individual Quarkus artifact versions.
